sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P1 as Guest
    participant P2 as Public link
    participant P3 as Invitations API
    participant P4 as RSVP DB
    participant P5 as Notification outbox
    P1->>P2: Open signed link
    P2->>P3: Validate signature
    P3->>P4: Submit ceremony RSVP
    P4->>P5: Persist response once
    P5-->>P1: Résultat / statut vérifié
